<!--
    SFTP browser for one connection profile.

    A browser, not a transfer screen: it connects with the same host-key
    consent the terminal uses, lists what the server offers, and hands every
    download and upload to the shared transfer manager (TransfersActivity),
    so progress and history live in one place rather than in this screen.
-->
